WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.240
Today is the day you've done the hard part. A few final reminders before you

2
00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:04.560
head in.

3
00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:08.960
Stop all clear liquids at least four hours before your procedure time. Nothing

4
00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:09.680
to drink after that

5
00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:15.150
point including water. Continue to avoid solid foods and alcohol. Avoid hard

6
00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:16.800
candy, gum, and mints.

7
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:22.180
These count as food and can affect your sedation. Take a moment to confirm that

8
00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:22.720
your output has

9
00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:26.480
been running clear. That's the sign that your prep has done its job. If you're

10
00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:27.200
not there yet,

11
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:31.280
please contact your doctor's office before coming in. Lastly, your driver

12
00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:32.400
should also be ready to go.

13
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:36.950
Your doctor is looking forward to seeing you and taking great care of you today

14
00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:37.200
.
